{"3676530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JohnJohnson: Remnant", "steam_appid": 3676530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you long wanted to dive into a crazy shooter where you have to kill animatronics?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>JohnJohnson: REMNANT</i> — a game made especially for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a mercenary. Weapon in hand, grim task: to clear out an entire network of entertainment complexes from crazed animatronics that clearly have something wrong with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They don’t just malfunction — they laugh, jump, sing, and try to tear you apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What went wrong? Why does it smell like rot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do these wind-up freaks… suffer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a new insane location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong>? An <strong>arcade-style adrenaline-fueled trash shooter</strong> with elements of platforming, mini-games, and even dark humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay? Shoot, smash, finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot enemies with various types of weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform executions — brutal, cartoonish, but very impressive ways to tear animatronics to pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mini-games (from arcade machines to rhythm games and races)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies aren’t boring either:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐻 <strong>Bob</strong> — a powerful berserker who rushes into melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐰 <strong>Rob</strong> — a guitarist with ranged sound attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐔 <strong>Charlie </strong>— summons mini-robot “cupcakes”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐺 <strong>Charles </strong>— a fast hunter who leaps from afar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And several more enemy types with unique mechanics that will surprise you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this — under brutal, sometimes experimental music and neon lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>The animatronics are already waiting for you...</i></u></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you long wanted to dive into a crazy shooter where you have to kill animatronics?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>JohnJohnson: REMNANT</i> — a game made especially for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a mercenary. Weapon in hand, grim task: to clear out an entire network of entertainment complexes from crazed animatronics that clearly have something wrong with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They don’t just malfunction — they laugh, jump, sing, and try to tear you apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What went wrong? Why does it smell like rot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do these wind-up freaks… suffer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a new insane location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong>? An <strong>arcade-style adrenaline-fueled trash shooter</strong> with elements of platforming, mini-games, and even dark humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay? Shoot, smash, finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot enemies with various types of weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform executions — brutal, cartoonish, but very impressive ways to tear animatronics to pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mini-games (from arcade machines to rhythm games and races)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies aren’t boring either:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐻 <strong>Bob</strong> — a powerful berserker who rushes into melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐰 <strong>Rob</strong> — a guitarist with ranged sound attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐔 <strong>Charlie </strong>— summons mini-robot “cupcakes”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐺 <strong>Charles </strong>— a fast hunter who leaps from afar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And several more enemy types with unique mechanics that will surprise you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this — under brutal, sometimes experimental music and neon lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>The animatronics are already waiting for you...</i></u></p>", "short_description": "They were made to entertain. But now they want to smash and kill.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676530/686157fcec1ed3c704c8ba0153daebc5564b5dae/header.jpg?t=1785445804", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676530/3b11cd0f4b875a681b0d7ddce80b0fb193d99294/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785445804", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676530/3b11cd0f4b875a681b0d7ddce80b0fb193d99294/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785445804", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Athlon gold 3150U <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon Graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Quadriple I"], "publishers": ["Quadriple I"], "demos": [{"appid": 3677840, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description"